    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Yoshwa Kūhaya Ya Kūmalīīja",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOS 24:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Na lūūlū ū Yoshwa ūbitana pye a banhū; ī ng'anda ja Baisilaeli ī jose jiibilingīla Shekemu. Hanuma ūbitana pye a banamhala na a batogeeji ba ng'anda, na a balamuji, hamò na a bagunanhi ba Baisilaeli; begeela kū būtongi bo ng'wa Mulungu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.24.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.24.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOS 24:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hūna ū Yoshwa ūbawīla pye a banhū gīkī, “Ū SEEBA Mulungu wa Baisilaeli alīhaya gīkī, ‘Ī kale a bakūlūgenji bing'we bikalaga kū sī ya nkīlo gwa Mongo, a bose kūfuma kūlī Teela, Abulahamu nū Nahooli; na baalī balamya ba baamulungu bangī ū kwenūko.’ ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.24.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.24.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOS 24:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Alīyo nūnsola ū nkūlūgenji wing'we ū Abulahamu kūfuma ū kū sī ya kū nkīlo gwa Mongo, nūntwaala hose pyī ū mu sī ya Kanaani; hanuma a banhū ba shibyalīlwe shakwe nūūbīīta kūbiza bingī no no no; nūng'winha ng'witūnja Isaka. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.24.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.24.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOS 24:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ū Isaka nang'hwe nūng'winha ba Esau na Yakobo; ū Esau nūng'winh sī ya Seili kūbiza yakwe, ū Yakobo ū ng'wene ūtulumenha kūja Misili hamò nū būbyīle wakwe. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.24.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.24.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOS 24:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Niza nūbatūma ba Musa na Alooni; a bana Misili nūbaluhya no mu nzīla ya mihayo īyo nakīīta ū mu sī yabo, hūna nūmufunya ū mu sī yenīyo a bing'we. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.24.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.24.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOS 24:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Aho naabīnja ī Misili a bakūlūgenji bing'we, būshimīza būūkashika kū nyanza; a bana Misili būbakūūbīja na magogoteni gabo, hamò na badamhīji ba falasa, nabo būūkashika ū kū Nyanza ī Yaaza. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.24.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.24.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOS 24:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Alīyo a bakūlūgenji bing'we būnīlīīla ū SEEBA gīkī abagune, ūchaamīka giiti a ha gatī ying'we na a bana Misili; hanuma wīīhamīla ī nyanza yūbakundīkīja a bana Misili. A miso ging'we gīībona pyī īyo nakabīītīla a bana Misili. Hanuma ya henaho ng'wikala mu sī y'itogolo ikanza lya shikū ningī. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.24.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.24.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOS 24:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hūna nūng'wenha kūshisha mu sī ya Baamooli, abo biikalaga kū ntambūko gwa kīya ya mongo gwa Yolodani. A banhū benabo bakagema ū kwilwisha ning'we, alīyo nūūbatūūla mu makono ging'we. Nūbakenaagūla ū kū būtongi wing'we, ng'wīdima bing'we ī sī yabo. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.24.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.24.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOS 24:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ū Balaaki ū ng'witūnja o ng'wa Zipooli, ūyo walī ntemi wa Moabu wibeeja beeja gīkī wize kūmudumīla; wanoga ūntūma Balaamu ng'witūnja o ng'wa Beoli, gīkī iize kūmuzuma. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.24.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.24.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOS 24:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Alīyo natandegelekile ū Balaamu, na lūūlū ūmufuuha ja lwīsī lwīsī; nūbiza nang'wīnja ū mu nkono gwakwe ū munhū ng'wenūyo.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.24.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.24.10"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOS 24:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.24.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.24.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOS 24:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "“Hanuma ya henaho ng'ūgūkīla ū mongo gwa Yolodani, ng'ūshika Yeliko. A biikaji ba Yeliko bilwisha ning'we būlūgū, gīt'ūmo bakīītīla na a Baamooli, Bapelizi, Bakanaani, Bahītī, Bagiligashi, Bahīvī, na Bayebusi; alīyo nabo nūbatūūla mu nkono gwing'we. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.24.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.24.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOS 24:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nūūtūma sali jūtonga ko jūbapeeja būng'wīngīla gīt'ūmo nakabīītīla a batemi a babīlī, a ba Baamooli. Ū gwenūyo mutagwītīle mu būdūla wa lūshū nūūlū būta wing'we. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.24.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.24.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOS 24:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Na lūūlū nūbiza nang'winha sī īyo mutīīnoganogelile, na mizengo īyo mutīzengile bing'we; h'ūmo mukwikalaga ī haha, na a matwajo ga mizabibu ayo mukūlyaga ī haha mutīhambile bing'we, pye na ga mizeituni.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.24.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.24.13"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOS 24:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.24.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.24.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOS 24:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Na lūūlū shing'wigelile mung'ogohe ū SEEBA, na muntūmamīle we mu wishigwa būtaale. Gaponyagi a maamulungu ayo bakūlūgenji bing'we baagalamyaga kū sī ya nkīlo gwa Mongo, hamò na mu sī ya Misili; mubize batūmami baa kūntūmamīla SEEBA. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.24.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.24.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOS 24:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Alīyo ūlū mulībona gūlīīlamba ū gwa kūntūmamīla ū SEEBA, numho solagi lūūlū ī lelo yenīyī ūyo mutogilwe kūntūmamīla; babize a baamulungu abo bakūlūgenji bing'we baabatūmamamīlaga kū sī ya nkīlo gwa Mongo, nūūlū a baamulungu ba Baamooli abo mukwikalaga mu sī yabo ī haha; alīyo ū nene nī kaya yane tūkūntūmamīla SEEBA.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.24.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.24.15"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Baisilaeli kūsola kūntūmamīla SEEBA",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOS 24:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.24.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.24.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOS 24:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hūna a banhū būshosha balīhaya, “A bise ngilo gete ū kūneka ū SEEBA na kwandya kūbatūmamīla baamulungu bangī, ni gūchīlage kūle. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.24.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.24.16"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOS 24:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nguno h'ū SEEBA Mulungu wei ng'wenekīlī ūyo watwīnja a bise na a bakūlūgenji bise ū mu sī ya Misili; ūtūfunya ū mu sī ya būsese yenīyo, wīta nī shimanīīkījo ī shitaale īsho akīīta kū būtongi wa miso gise. Nū mu lūgendo lwise ū lose hū ng'wene ūyo watūlang'hana, pye nū mu mahanga a gose ūmo twabītaga. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.24.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.24.17"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "18",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOS 24:18"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nīyo ū SEEBA hū ng'wene wagapeegije a mahanga gūtwīngīla, pye na a Baamooli abo biikalaga ū mu sī yenīyī. Na lūūlū na a bise tūkūntūmamīla ū SEEBA, nguno hū ng'wene ū Mulungu wise.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.24.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.24.18"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "19",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOS 24:19"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "19",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ū Yoshwa ūbawīla a banhū gīkī, “A bing'we mutūdūla ū kūntūmamīla ū SEEBA, nguno ū wei alī Mulungu ng'wela, na Mulungu wa wilu. Atūmuleka ng'wikale na būūshitiigwa wing'we, hamò na būkenaagūji wing'we gīko. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.24.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.24.19"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "20",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOS 24:20"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "20",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ūlū ng'ūneka ū SEEBA ng'wandya kūtūmamīla baamulungu bageni, akūgalūka ang'wenhele mihayo ya kūmukenaagūla na kūmumala gete, nūūlū īkī ī haha alī wawiza ū kū bing'we.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.24.20",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.24.20"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "21",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOS 24:21"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "21",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Alīyo a banhū būnshokeja ū Yoshwa balīhaya gīkī, “Ītī gīko! Tūkūntūmamīla dūhū ū SEEBA.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.24.21",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.24.21"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "22",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOS 24:22"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "22",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nang'hwe ūbawīla, “Ng'wikaanīla bing'we benekīlī gīkī ng'wasolaga gwa kūntūmaīla SEEBA.” Nabo būshosha balīhaya, “Ūlītūngīlīja tūlī bakaanīji ng'hana.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.24.22",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.24.22"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "23",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOS 24:23"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "23",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "A henaho ū Yoshwa ūbawīla, “Na lūūlū gīnjagi a maamulungu a mageni ayo mulī nago, ī ng'holò jing'we jingalūkīle SEEBA, ū Mulungu wa Baisilaeli.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.24.23",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.24.23"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "24",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOS 24:24"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "24",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "A banhū būnshokeja hangī ū Yoshwa balīhaya gīkī, “Tūkūntūmamīla ū SEEBA Mulungu wise, na tūkūbiza biigwi ū kūlī wei.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.24.24",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.24.24"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
