          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "25",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOS 24:25"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "25",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ū mu lūshikū lwenūlo aho balī Shekemu, ū Yoshwa ūbeeja ilagane kūlwa nguno yabo a banhū, ūbatūūlīla na malange hamò na shilagīlo. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.24.25",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.24.25"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "26",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOS 24:26"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "26",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ū Yoshwa wīyandīka ī mihayo yenīyo mu Shitabo sha Shilagīlo sha ng'wa Mulungu. Hūna ūsola iwe itaale ūlīsīmbīla lyīmīīla ho a henaho, yaalī ha sīlīlī ya ntī gwalī bbihī n'ipandī lyeela lya ng'wa SEEBA. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.24.26",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.24.26"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "27",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOS 24:27"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "27",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hanuma ūbawīla a banhū gīkī, “Ī liwe īlo mulīīlībona lyenīlī, līkūbiza lya kūtūkaanīla, nguno lyayigwaaga pyī ī mihayo īyo watūwīlaga ū SEEBA. Līkūmukaanīla ūlū ng'ūlekaana nū būtūngīlīja wing'we ū kūlī Mulungu wing'we.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.24.27",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.24.27"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "28",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOS 24:28"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "28",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hanuma ya yenīyī ū Yoshwa ūbalaga a banhū būja, būlī ng'wene ūja kū sī ya wingīji wakwe.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.24.28",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.24.28"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Kūcha kwa ng'wa Yoshwa",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "28",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOS 24:28"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "28",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.24.28",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.24.28"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "29",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOS 24:29"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "29",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hūna lūūlū a hanuma ya yose yenīyī, ū Yoshwa ū ntūmami o ng'wa SEEBA ūcha alī na būlamu wa myaka igana n'ikūmi līmò. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.24.29",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.24.29"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "30",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOS 24:30"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "30",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Būnjīka ū mu sī ya wingīji wakwe, mu nzengo gwa Timuna-sela, mu sī ya magūlya ya banhū ba lūganda lwa Efulaimu, sukuma ya lūgūlū lwa Gaashi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.24.30",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.24.30"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "31",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOS 24:31"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "31",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "A Baisilaeli bakantūmamīla ū SEEBA ū mu shikū ja būlamu bo ng'wa Yoshwa ī jose, hamò nī ja bataale abo akabaleka ho ū Yoshwa, abo baalī bīībona pyī īyo SEEBA walī wabīītīla a Baisilaeli. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.24.31",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.24.31"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "32",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOS 24:32"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "32",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "A maguha ga ng'wa Yosefu ayo baalī baagenha a Baisilaeli kūfuma Misili nago gaalī gaajīkīlwa Shekemu, ū ng'wipandī lya sī īlo Yakobo waalī walīgūla shipande igana sha feza, kūfuma kūlī ise o ng'wa Shekemu; ūmò wa bitūnja ba ng'wa Hamooli. Ī lipandī lyenīlo lyūbiza sī ya wingīji kūlwa banhū ba shibyalīlwe sha ng'wa Yosefu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.24.32",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.24.32"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "33",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOS 24:33"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "33",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nū Elieza ū ng'witūnja o ng'wa Alooni ūcha ūjīkīlwa Gibea, īyo walī wagabīlwa Finehasi ng'witūnja wakwe, mu sī ya magūlya ya banhū ba lūganda lwa Efulaimu.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.24.33",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.24.33"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    }
